<figure class="pc-architecture" aria-labelledby="pc-diagram-caption">
  <div class="diagram-heading"><span>Application architecture</span><span class="status">Working proof of concept</span></div>
  <div class="agent-node">
    <span class="node-label">Your interface</span>
    <strong>Coding agent</strong>
    <p>Reads the schema. Interprets the request. Chooses the operation.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="paths">
    <div class="path read-path">
      <span class="connector" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
      <span class="path-label">Read with SQL</span>
      <strong>PocketContext query endpoint</strong>
      <p>Table and column permissions<br />Read-only connection · Query limits</p>
      <span class="connector" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
    </div>
    <div class="path write-path">
      <span class="connector" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
      <span class="path-label">Write through the API</span>
      <strong>PocketBase record operations</strong>
      <p>Authentication · Validation<br />Business rules and hooks</p>
      <span class="connector" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="database-node">
    <span class="node-label">One SQLite database</span>
    <strong>DealContext schema</strong>
    <p>People · Organizations · Deals · Pipelines · Stages · Activities · Notes</p>
  </div>
  <p class="admin-note">PocketBase's existing CRUD dashboard handles manual administration.</p>
  <div class="deployment">
    <div class="diagram-heading"><span>Deployment and recovery</span><span class="status planned">Proposed Colors package</span></div>
    <div class="services">
      <div><strong>Colors + ONCE</strong><span>Host and application</span></div>
      <div><strong>Cloudflare DNS</strong><span>Application domain</span></div>
      <div><strong>Resend</strong><span>Email delivery</span></div>
      <div><strong>Litestream + S3</strong><span>Database replication</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="restore">Recovery check: restore onto a replacement host and verify application data.</p>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="pc-diagram-caption">The agent queries context with SQL and changes records through PocketBase. The Colors deployment and recovery package is proposed. DealContext still needs server enforcement for some lifecycle rules.</figcaption>
</figure>

